Spofy provides four search commands, each targeting a specific entity type: @*

@itemize
@item
@code{spofy-search-tracks} searches for matching tracks. @*
@item
@code{spofy-search-albums} searches for matching albums. @*
@item
@code{spofy-search-artists} searches for matching artists. @*
@item
@code{spofy-search-playlists} searches for matching playlists. @*
@end itemize

When @code{spofy-consult} is loaded, these commands use incremental search via @code{consult--dynamic-collection}: the minibuffer appears immediately and candidates update live as you type.  Without @code{spofy-consult}, they fall back to prompting for a query string and displaying results in a tabulated list. @*

Each command creates a @samp{*Spofy Search: TYPE*} buffer using @code{tabulated-list-mode}.  The columns vary by entity type: @*

