@item Artists
@tab Name, Genres, Followers
@item Playlists
@tab Name, Owner, Tracks, Public
@end multitable

If the currently playing track appears in the search results, it is highlighted with the @code{spofy-playing} face across all columns and prefixed with a ▶ icon.  The highlight updates automatically when the track changes, so there is no need to press @samp{g} to see which track is now playing. @*

